@AniCard_HostAddress = http://localhost:5145/
@authEndpoint = {{AniCard_HostAddress}}api/v1/auth
@characterEndpoint = {{AniCard_HostAddress}}api/character

### 1. Register a new user
POST {{authEndpoint}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

### 2. Login (captures JWT token from response)
# @name login
POST {{authEndpoint}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

### 3. Access protected endpoint (requires valid token)
GET {{authEndpoint}}/protected
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

POST {{characterEndpoint}}/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Description"

Some description
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Tags"

string,string,string
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="Koikatu_F_20250918135054699_Hiiragi Konomi.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./Koikatu_F_20250918135054699_Hiiragi Konomi.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###
